      "enrollment": 60,
      "start_date": "2026-11-01",
      "completion_date": "2027-03-01",
      "summary": "This open-label, single-group, non-randomized interventional study will evaluate longitudinal changes in anxiety symptoms, sleep quality, psychological well-being, treatment adherence, tolerability, and safety in adults with clinician-confirmed generalized anxiety disorder. Participants will receive CannaRiver CBD Calm, an oral/sublingual broad-spectrum cannabinoid tincture containing cannabidiol (CBD), cannabinol (CBN), and cannabigerol (CBG), at a protocol dose of 0.5 mL approximately every 12 hours for 8 weeks. Follow-up will continue through Week 12. The study has no placebo or concurrent ",
