      "enrollment": 38,
      "start_date": "2022-03-24",
      "completion_date": "2023-11-28",
      "summary": "The purpose of this study is to examine the effects of hemp-derived cannabigerol (CBG) on anxiety, stress, mood, and cognition. Further, the severity of various side effects of CBG (sleepiness, dry mouth, dry eyes, increased appetite) will be assessed. As such, the study is focused on better understanding some of the potentially beneficial and detrimental effects of CBG on humans.",
